<BaseLayout title="Cookies & privacy choices | Zion Creative" description="Cookies & privacy choices for Zion Creative."><Header/><main id="main" class="container policy-page"><h1>Cookies & privacy choices</h1><p>Elfsight contact forms and reviews load directly on the pages where they appear. The Calendly scheduler loads directly on the consultation page.</p><h2>Your choice</h2><p>You can browse other pages without opening forms, reviews, or scheduling pages. Embedded services connect to their providers when those pages load. Manage provider cookies and browser storage through your browser settings; clearing them does not delete information you have already submitted.</p><h2>Storage and tracking</h2><p>The website does not include advertising pixels in its source code. Cloudflare supplies a browser beacon on the live site for site traffic and performance measurement. This hosting-level feature operates separately from the embedded services. Cloudflare also provides hosting and security and may process technical request information. See <a href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/web-analytics/about/">Cloudflare’s Web Analytics documentation</a> and <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">privacy policy</a>.</p><p>Elfsight may use its own cookies and browser storage when a form or reviews widget loads. Calendly may do so when the consultation page loads. Read the <a href="https://elfsight.com/privacy-policy/">Elfsight privacy policy</a> and <a href="https://calendly.com/legal/privacy-notice">Calendly privacy notice</a>. Provider behavior can change independently of this website.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>For questions, use <a href="mailto:hello@zioncreative.co">hello@zioncreative.co</a> or <a href="tel:+12177252031">217.725.2031</a>. Read the <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a> for more information.</p></main><Footer/></BaseLayout>
